       },
       "hide": null,
       "html": "<p>Hi Everyone, I am Owen!</p><p>I live in a small town 30 minutes south of Boston, and I am going into my senior year of high school.  I grew up right next door to my grandparents, who both emigrated from Ireland, so I grew up with a strong Irish influence.  My brother went on the Irish Life Experience in 2012, and he had the time of his life.  His high praise of the trip and the ILE Staff convinced me to join, so this summer I joined #ILE15, and had the best summer of my life!  Everyone involved is so friendly and kind and you will instantly feel apart of everything.  The ILE Staff is full of funny and awesome people and your fellow ILE members will become some of your greatest friends.  Ireland is such an amazing country and I encourage you to join while you can!</p>"
